# Workspace-managed reference checkouts (declared in repos/codemirror-*.toml and
# cloned by `repro`). Ignored here for the same reason `reprobuild/references/*`
# is: the checkouts belong to the workspace, not to this repo's history. Left
# untracked and unignored they make the pre-push gate see a dirty tree.
